Derek H. Lister, *Corrosion for Engineers*, University of New Brunswick and Chulalongkorn University. [Chapter 13: Corrosion Current, CANteach institutional copy](https://canteach.candu.org/Content%20Library/20053213.pdf).

Read all 37 pages for partial currents, unequal anodic/cathodic areas, charge-transfer kinetics, transport and polarization. Use this substantial written account alongside the complete NPTEL environmental-degradation course already referenced in metallurgy. The chapter is not presented as the entire Lister course.

Title, institutional attribution and selected opening, area-balance and kinetic passages were inspected on 30 October 2026. Historical notation and rounded constants need reconciliation with the actual quantity conventions. The institutional PDF is freely readable; no general adaptation licence was established. Keep the chapter and its credited figures external.

